{
    "title": "Music player & mp3 player",
    "description": "Play Music with multifunctional & useful Music Player & MP3 Player, Audio Player, Music Apps & MP3 Cutter.\r\n\r\nPlay music with Stylish, Powerful and Fast Music-Player. Music player & mp3 player is the Perfect music player for Android with tons of features and an attractive design. This Offline MP3 Player has a built-in equalizer that takes your music listening experience to a completely new level.\r\n\r\nMusic player & mp3 player is a well-known android MP3 Player with powerful equalizer, mp3 cutter, lyrics, etc. This Music Player App lets you easily manage all your offline music play in one place. It has a unique battery saving feature, it takes much less memory and provides a perfect music play experience.\r\n\r\n\u2605 All audio formats supported by one MP3 Player\r\nMusic player & mp3 player is not just an MP3-player, it also supports all music and audio formats, such as MP3, MIDI, WAV, FLAC, AAC, APE, etc. and plays them in high quality.\r\n\r\n\u2605 Stylish Themes \r\nAdd your own picture as background. Gorgeous background skins. Customize with tons of colors to make your music player look outstanding. \r\n\r\n\u2605 Powerful Equalizer \r\nBoost your music play experience with 10 amazing presets, 5 bands, bass boost, virtualizer & 3D reverb effects adjustments and much more. \r\n\r\n\u2605 Built-in MP3 cutter - Ringtone Maker \r\nEasily cut the best part of the audio songs and save it as Ringtone, Alarm, Notification, Music file, etc.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n*Music player & mp3 player is the best Offline Music Player, MP3 Player, Audio-Player, and Songs Player with a powerful equalizer.\r\n*Music player & mp3 player with features like shake to change song, lyrics, crossfade, sleep timer, android auto & shuffle music.\r\n*Browse and play music by Albums, Artists, Playlists, Genres, Folders, etc.\r\n*Music player & mp3 player supports smart & custom playlists with a backup/restore option.\r\n*Easily search and play music/songs by keywords.\r\n*Perfect workout music app.\r\n*Stylish widgets (4x4,4x2,4x1,4x1) are supported in this music player.\r\n\r\nIf you are confused about choosing a replacement for the default music player app, Music player & mp3 player is here for you. You deserve to download this ideal substitute called Music player & mp3 player.\r\n\r\nPlease note:\r\nMusic player & mp3 player  is the Perfect Offline Music Player - MP3 Player app. It doesn't support online music downloads or online music streaming. \r\n\r\nFor any queries/suggestions reach out to us at fimtersapp@gmail.com , we appreciate your kind support and patience. Please download Music player & mp3 player and give it a try.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play Music with multifunctional &amp; useful Music Player &amp; MP3 Player, Audio Player, Music Apps &amp; MP3 Cutter.<br><br>Play music with Stylish, Powerful and Fast Music-Player. Music player &amp; mp3 player is the Perfect music player for Android with tons of features and an attractive design. This Offline MP3 Player has a built-in equalizer that takes your music listening experience to a completely new level.<br><br>Music player &amp; mp3 player is a well-known android MP3 Player with powerful equalizer, mp3 cutter, lyrics, etc. This Music Player App lets you easily manage all your offline music play in one place. It has a unique battery saving feature, it takes much less memory and provides a perfect music play experience.<br><br>\u2605 All audio formats supported by one MP3 Player<br>Music player &amp; mp3 player is not just an MP3-player, it also supports all music and audio formats, such as MP3, MIDI, WAV, FLAC, AAC, APE, etc. and plays them in high quality.<br><br>\u2605 Stylish Themes <br>Add your own picture as background. Gorgeous background skins. Customize with tons of colors to make your music player look outstanding. <br><br>\u2605 Powerful Equalizer <br>Boost your music play experience with 10 amazing presets, 5 bands, bass boost, virtualizer &amp; 3D reverb effects adjustments and much more. <br><br>\u2605 Built-in MP3 cutter - Ringtone Maker <br>Easily cut the best part of the audio songs and save it as Ringtone, Alarm, Notification, Music file, etc.<br><br>Key Features:<br>*Music player &amp; mp3 player is the best Offline Music Player, MP3 Player, Audio-Player, and Songs Player with a powerful equalizer.<br>*Music player &amp; mp3 player with features like shake to change song, lyrics, crossfade, sleep timer, android auto &amp; shuffle music.<br>*Browse and play music by Albums, Artists, Playlists, Genres, Folders, etc.<br>*Music player &amp; mp3 player supports smart &amp; custom playlists with a backup/restore option.<br>*Easily search and play music/songs by keywords.<br>*Perfect workout music app.<br>*Stylish widgets (4x4,4x2,4x1,4x1) are supported in this music player.<br><br>If you are confused about choosing a replacement for the default music player app, Music player &amp; mp3 player is here for you. You deserve to download this ideal substitute called Music player &amp; mp3 player.<br><br>Please note:<br>Music player &amp; mp3 player  is the Perfect Offline Music Player - MP3 Player app. It doesn&#39;t support online music downloads or online music streaming. <br><br>For any queries/suggestions reach out to us at fimtersapp@gmail.com , we appreciate your kind support and patience. Please download Music player &amp; mp3 player and give it a try.",
